          "text": "-\tQC supports this and thinks there is no problem if new bands will be introduced within the Ku band"
        },
        {
          "source_coordinate": "body/b5124",
          "text": "-\tMTK thinks both approaches would work but has a slight preference to confirm the WA"
        }
      ],
      "excluded_following_source_paragraphs": [
        {
          "source_coordinate": "body/b5126",
          "text": "Proposal 2\tIn VSAT capability field descriptions, frequency information is specified to clarify which capability is used."
