          "text": "In VSAT capability field descriptions, frequency information is specified to clarify which capability is used"
        },
        {
          "source_coordinate": "body/b5128",
          "text": "Proposal 3\tOnly Rel-19 (draft) CRs are provided for Ku Band Capability."
        },
        {
          "source_coordinate": "body/b5129",
          "text": "Only Rel-19 (draft) CRs are provided for Ku Band Capability (no pre Rel-19 CRs)"
        },
        {
          "source_coordinate": "body/b5130",
          "text": "Proposal 4\tClarify FR1-NTN terminology in TS 38.306 and TS 38.331."
